<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_section"><a href="#S5" title="In JaccDiv: A Metric and Benchmark for Quantifying Diversity of Generated Marketing Text in the Music Industry" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">5 </span>Results and Discussions:</span></a>
